01:40:07.448 --> 01:40:09.751
No. Yet another thing I don't know.


01:40:09.752 --> 01:40:11.586
<i>Well, polyphony is</i>


01:40:11.587 --> 01:40:13.353
<i>from the middle ages.</i>


01:40:13.354 --> 01:40:15.890
