European phenomenon.


01:40:15.891 --> 01:40:17.859
It's distinguished by...


01:40:17.860 --> 01:40:20.762
By the idea that every voice


01:40:20.763 --> 01:40:23.431
<i>is its own melody</i>


01:40:23.432 --> 01:40:26.533
